":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzYyNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3836276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcwardell7","html_url":"https://github.com/dcwardell7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcwardell7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcwardell7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcwardell7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcwardell7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcwardell7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcwardell7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcwardell7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcwardell7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcwardell7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-02T01:57:29Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T01:58:10Z","body":"For anyone else running into this issue.\n\nThe [code responsible](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0fdbf050e0c7fc7e0a9d42c2a41ee3bfdffbd8f1/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/canvas.glsl#L751) for this setting does take LIGHT_COLOR into consideration, but it only inspects the LIGHT_COLOR's alpha channel.\n\nTo resolve the issue, the texture you use to setup the PointLight2D node needs to be configured correctly.\n\nAll the examples I've seen use a white and black texture which will not work. Instead, I've found success using a white and transparent texture.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477140998/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]